rweapons</strong>, and <strong>4 Side weapons</strong> at your fancy. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>400 \u2018cards\u2019</strong> to choose from, in multiple rarities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metaprogression in the form of <strong>84 permanent upgrade points</strong>, plus purchasable one-time items, to turn your Second Rates into eventual First Rates.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>86 unlockable</strong> weapons, cards, lore and even music. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 different stages in 3 different difficulties.</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 heart-pounding musical tracks </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hours upon hours of frustration, challenge, and heart-pounding fun. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100% original hand drawn art.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094740/extras/a901d51943f76cd2c76374de35cebc99.avif?t=1753622853\" width=600 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094740/extras/7cba47f795ed19da662f2ef7c3197d1e.poster.avif?t=1753622853\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094740/extras/7cba47f795ed19da662f2ef7c3197d1e.webm?t=1753622853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094740/extras/7cba47f795ed19da662f2ef7c3197d1e.mp4?t=1753622853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Potential Future Roadmap:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Unlocks.</